sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant M as ModeTransition / Policy Owner
    participant D as Display Adapter
    participant W as Windows CCD
    participant J as Transition Journal

    M->>D: ResolveTarget(policyTarget, fresh generation)
    D->>W: GetDisplayConfigBufferSizes + QueryDisplayConfig
    W-->>D: current paths/modes
    D-->>M: resolved display target + generation

    M->>J: persist resolved action / source evidence
    M->>D: ValidateTarget(resolvedTarget)
    D->>W: SetDisplayConfig(SDC_VALIDATE | supplied config)
    W-->>D: validation result

    alt validation rejected
        D-->>M: OPERATION_REJECTED
    else validation accepted
        M->>D: ApplyTarget(resolvedTarget)
        D->>W: SetDisplayConfig(SDC_APPLY | supplied config)
        W-->>D: technical result
        D->>W: QueryDisplayConfig fresh read-back
        W-->>D: actual paths/modes
        D->>D: verify target predicates
        alt all mandatory display predicates satisfied
            D-->>M: APPLIED_VERIFIED + actual evidence
            M->>J: mark display action VERIFIED
        else topology changed / mismatch
            D-->>M: STALE_SNAPSHOT / VERIFICATION_FAILED
            M->>J: mark action FAILED
        end
    end

    Note over M,J: Display success never commits WORK/GAME by itself. SPEC-05 commits only after all mandatory target predicates pass.
